    "ss_testimonial_12_tDJqL7": {
      "type": "ss-testimonial-12",
      "blocks": {
        "slide_EnjbeU": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "media_style": "image",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/il_1588xN.8426535249_hjg1.jpg",
            "video_url": "",
            "controls": false,
            "stars_count": 0,
            "text": "<p>I never knew a little piece of the Irish coast could become something I’d wear every day.</p>",
            "author": "<p>Eabha Kearney, Kilkee</p>"
          }
        },
        "slide_zw6rbz": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "media_style": "image",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/il_1588xN.8064599634_bi3o.jpg",
            "video_url": "",
            "controls": false,
            "stars_count": 0,
            "text": "<p>I wanted jewellery that felt personal, not something you see everywhere.<br/><br/>Something with a story behind it.</p>",
            "author": "<p>Aisling Moran, Ballyvaughan</p>"
          }
        },
        "slide_Vz4ffE": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "media_style": "image",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/iap_1200x1200.3438481263_pm4pfa8u.png",
            "video_url": "",
            "controls": false,
            "stars_count": 0,
            "text": "<p>The thought of wearing a stone shaped by the Atlantic just felt so much more meaningful than buying something mass-produced.</p>",
            "author": "<p>Gráinne Walsh, Keel</p>"
          }
        },
        "slide_Qzkdhd": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "media_style": "image",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/iap_1200x1200.8209727251_gtj4rb1s.png",
            "video_url": "",
            "controls": false,
            "stars_count": 0,
            "text": "<p>My stone was found along the West Coast of Ireland and turned into a piece made just for me...<br/><br/>That makes it feel completely different.!</p>",
            "author": "<p>Sorcha Ní Bhraonáin, Kinvara</p>"
          }
        },
        "slide_bLANYH": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "media_style": "image",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/iap_1200x1200.7777959751_5kjcdwww.png",
            "video_url": "",
            "controls": false,
            "stars_count": 0,
            "text": "<p>I just got my ring today, and I cant stop staring at it. It was totally worth the wait and I am beyond happy. Thank you!!</p>",
            "author": "<p>Caoimhe Ryan, Roundstone</p>"
          }
        },
        "slide_ifdmp6": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "media_style": "image",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/iap_1200x1200.7473159858_qyspf2gd.png",
            "video_url": "",
            "controls": false,
            "stars_count": 0,
            "text": "<p>Everything I found felt so ordinary.<br/><br/>I wanted something that couldn't have been made for anyone else</p>",
            "author": "<p>Róisín Daly, Doolin</p>"
          }
        },
        "slide_rBpmjQ": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "media_style": "image",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/iap_1200x1200.7310961705_oo7et47x.png",
            "video_url": "",
            "controls": false,
            "stars_count": 0,
            "text": "<p>I thought I was just buying a piece of jewellery.<br/><br/>I didn't expect it to remind me of home.</p>",
            "author": "<p>Orlaith Byrne, Westport</p>"
          }
        }
      },
